Build tools

The pom.xml configures the following Maven plugins:

Maven Compiler Plugin 3.14.1 — Apache License 2.0.
Maven JAR Plugin 3.4.2 — Apache License 2.0.
Maven Shade Plugin 3.6.1 — Apache License 2.0.

These plugins are build-time tools and are not normally part of the distributed application merely because they are used to build it. Their respective licences apply to the plugins themselves.

