Redistribution

When redistributing javTex, retain the applicable third-party copyright, licence, and notice information. Where a third-party component's licence or distribution includes a NOTICE file, include applicable notices as required by that licence.

Before publishing a release, review the complete runtime dependency tree (for example, by running mvn dependency:tree) and verify that the licence and notice requirements of all included components are satisfied.